tball/recruiting/story/_/id/48543549/college-football-recruiting-2027-prospects-five-star-scouts-take","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-27T15:51:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Houston, rivalry color rushes lead top uniforms of CFB Week 13","description":"Just because it's rivalry week doesn't mean teams still can't put their best foot forward with uniform swag.","published":"2026-11-27T15:00:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50598211/college-football-uniforms-week-13-houston","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5160962/john-henry-daley","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Henry_Daley"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"John Henry Daley","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Henry_Daley","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:07Z","intro":"John Henry Daley is an American college football defensive end for the Michigan Wolverines. He previously played for the BYU Cougars and Utah Utes.","sections":[{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"After two years on a Mormon mission, Daley joined BYU in 2023 and played in three games recording three tackles. After the season, he transferred to the University of Utah. In his first year at Utah in 2024, he played in seven games and had four tackles and a sack. Daley returned to Utah in 2025 and was a first-team All-American, finishing the season with 48 tackles and 11.5 sacks.\nIn January 2026, Daley transferred to the University of Michigan, following head coach Kyle Whittingham from Utah. On September 14, following his second game at Michigan, Daley earned Big Ten Defensive Player of the Week honors following his eight tackle, three TFL and one sack performance in the win against No. 11 Oklahoma."}]}}